msgstr "Try it on"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "You are not allowed to manage Curtain settings."
msgstr "Je hebt geen toestemming om de Curtain-instellingen te beheren."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Neither libsodium nor OpenSSL is available on this server, so the Curtain API key is stored unencrypted in the database. Ask your host to enable the sodium extension."
msgstr "Op deze server is libsodium noch OpenSSL beschikbaar, dus de Curtain-API-sleutel wordt onversleuteld in de database opgeslagen. Vraag je host om de sodium-extensie in te schakelen."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Instellingen opgeslagen."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "This site is already connected to Curtain. Paste the API key from your Curtain console below, or rotate it there first."
msgstr "Deze site is al gekoppeld met Curtain. Plak hieronder de API-sleutel uit je Curtain-console, of vernieuw hem daar eerst."

#. translators: %s: error message
#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Could not connect: %s"
msgstr "Koppelen mislukt: %s"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Could not connect: the payment page address was not a Stripe Checkout page."
msgstr "Koppelen mislukt: het adres van de betaalpagina was geen Stripe Checkout-pagina."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "No pending connection. Click Connect to start."
msgstr "Er loopt geen koppeling. Klik op Koppelen om te beginnen."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Checkout has not completed yet. Finish the payment, then click \"Finish connection\"."
msgstr "De betaling is nog niet afgerond. Rond de betaling af en klik dan op \"Koppeling afronden\"."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Curtain could not confirm that this site asked for the connection. Make sure the site is reachable from the internet (not a local or private address) and that no security plugin blocks /wp-json/curtain/v1/verify, then click \"Finish connection\"."
msgstr "Curtain kon niet bevestigen dat deze site de koppeling heeft aangevraagd. Zorg dat de site bereikbaar is via internet (geen lokaal of privéadres) en dat geen beveiligingsplugin /wp-json/curtain/v1/verify blokkeert, en klik dan op \"Koppeling afronden\"."

#. translators: %s: error message
#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Could not finish the connection: %s"
msgstr "De koppeling kon niet worden afgerond: %s"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Connected to Curtain. Your published products are being synced in the background."
msgstr "Gekoppeld met Curtain. Je gepubliceerde producten worden op de achtergrond gesynchroniseerd."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "That does not look like a Curtain secret key (sk_live_… or sk_test_…)."
msgstr "Dat lijkt geen geheime Curtain-sleutel (sk_live_… of sk_test_…)."

#. translators: %s: error message
#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "The key was rejected: %s"
msgstr "De sleutel is geweigerd: %s"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Key accepted. Your published products are being synced in the background."
msgstr "Sleutel geaccepteerd. Je gepubliceerde producten worden op de achtergrond gesynchroniseerd."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Disconnected. The button is no longer shown and nothing is sent to Curtain. Your garment data stays in WooCommerce."
msgstr "Ontkoppeld. De knop wordt niet meer getoond en er wordt niets naar Curtain gestuurd. Je kledinggegevens blijven in WooCommerce."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Status refreshed."
msgstr "Status vernieuwd."

#. translators: %s: error message
#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Status check failed: %s"
msgstr "Statuscontrole mislukt: %s"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Connect the shop first."
msgstr "Koppel eerst de winkel."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Full sync queued. Products are pushed in the background."
msgstr "Volledige synchronisatie ingepland. Producten worden op de achtergrond verstuurd."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Curtain is a private fitting room: shoppers find their size right on your product page, no app needed. Their measurements stay in their own browser. Only garment data (size charts, fabric, photos) leaves this site, never customer data."
msgstr "Curtain is een privé-paskamer: shoppers vinden hun maat direct op je productpagina, zonder app. Hun maten blijven in hun eigen browser. Alleen kledingdata (maattabellen, stof, foto's) verlaat deze site, nooit klantgegevens."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Koppeling"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Gekoppeld"

#. translators: %s: plan name
#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "plan: %s"
msgstr "plan: %s"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "paused (no active subscription: the button still renders, shoppers see a \"shop paused\" screen)"
msgstr "gepauzeerd (geen actief abonnement: de knop blijft zichtbaar, shoppers zien een scherm \"winkel gepauzeerd\")"

#. translators: 1: key storage scheme, 2: queue backend
#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Key stored with %1$s · job queue: %2$s"
msgstr "Sleutel opgeslagen met %1$s · takenwachtrij: %2$s"

#. translators: %d: number of jobs
#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "%d pending job"
msgid_plural "%d pending jobs"
msgstr[0] "%d taak in de wachtrij"
msgstr[1] "%d taken in de wachtrij"

#. translators: %s: date
#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "last sync %s"
msgstr "laatste synchronisatie %s"

#. translators: %s: error message
#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Last error: %s"
msgstr "Laatste fout: %s"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Waiting for checkout to complete."
msgstr "Wachten tot de betaling is afgerond."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Not connected — nothing is sent to Curtain."
msgstr "Niet gekoppeld — er wordt niets naar Curtain gestuurd."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Acties"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Check status"
msgstr "Status controleren"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Sync all products"
msgstr "Alle producten synchroniseren"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Disconnect this shop from Curtain?"
msgstr "Deze winkel ontkoppelen van Curtain?"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Ontkoppelen"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Connect to Curtain"
msgstr "Koppelen met Curtain"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Finish connection"
msgstr "Koppeling afronden"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Connect sends your site URL and shop name to Curtain, creates your merchant account and (when billing is enabled) takes you to Stripe Checkout. You will be sent back here afterwards."
msgstr "Koppelen stuurt de URL van je site en de naam van je winkel naar Curtain, maakt je verkopersaccount aan en brengt je (als facturering aan staat) naar Stripe Checkout. Daarna kom je hier terug."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Or paste an API key"
msgstr "Of plak een API-sleutel"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Use key"
msgstr "Sleutel gebruiken"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Secret key from your Curtain merchant console. It is stored encrypted and never shown again."
msgstr "Geheime sleutel uit je Curtain-verkopersconsole. Hij wordt versleuteld opgeslagen en nooit meer getoond."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Storefront button"
msgstr "Knop in de winkel"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Show button"
msgstr "Knop tonen"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Add a \"Try it on\" button to single product pages (bundled script, no third-party requests)."
msgstr "Voeg een knop \"Try it on\" toe aan productpagina's (meegeleverd script, geen verzoeken naar derden)."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "You can also place it yourself with the [curtain_button] shortcode."
msgstr "Je kunt hem ook zelf plaatsen met de shortcode [curtain_button]."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Experience"
msgstr "Ervaring"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "On the product page (no app needed)"
msgstr "Op de productpagina (geen app nodig)"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Curtain app"
msgstr "Curtain-app"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "On the product page: shoppers get their recommended size in an overlay on your product page and Curtain selects it in the size dropdown. Curtain app: phones open the Curtain app, desktops show a QR code."
msgstr "Op de productpagina: shoppers krijgen hun aanbevolen maat in een venster op je productpagina en Curtain selecteert die in de maatkeuzelijst. Curtain-app: telefoons openen de Curtain-app, desktops tonen een QR-code."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Size attribute"
msgstr "Maatattribuut"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "The product attribute that holds the size in your variation dropdowns. Curtain selects the recommended size in it."
msgstr "Het productattribuut met de maat in je variatiekeuzelijsten. Curtain selecteert daarin de aanbevolen maat."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Shopper's size"
msgstr "Maat van de shopper"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Show the shopper's size on product pages"
msgstr "Toon de maat van de shopper op productpagina's"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "A shopper who found their size here before sees it next to the button, with a small drawing of their figure in that size, without clicking. Only the shopper sees it: your store cannot read it. Not shown with the Curtain app experience."
msgstr "Een shopper die hier eerder zijn maat vond, ziet die naast de knop, met een kleine tekening van zijn figuur in die maat, zonder te klikken. Alleen de shopper ziet het: je winkel kan het niet lezen. Niet getoond bij de ervaring Curtain-app."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Show for"
msgstr "Tonen bij"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Products synced as complete (\"active\") only"
msgstr "Alleen producten die als volledig (\"actief\") zijn gesynchroniseerd"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "All published products"
msgstr "Alle gepubliceerde producten"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Positie"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "woocommerce_single_product_summary priority: 35 = after the add-to-cart form, 25 = before it, 15 = after the price."
msgstr "Prioriteit in woocommerce_single_product_summary: 35 = na het winkelwagenformulier, 25 = ervoor, 15 = na de prijs."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Label"
msgstr "Tekst"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Taal"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Follow the site language"
msgstr "Taal van de site volgen"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Catalogue"
msgstr "Catalogus"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Default brand"
msgstr "Standaardmerk"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Used when a product has no brand (Curtain field, Brands taxonomy or a \"Brand\" attribute)."
msgstr "Gebruikt als een product geen merk heeft (Curtain-veld, taxonomie Merken of een attribuut \"Merk\")."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Sponsored placement"
msgstr "Gesponsorde plaatsing"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Allow my products to appear as sponsored cards in the Curtain swipe deck (billed per plan)."
msgstr "Mijn producten mogen als gesponsorde kaarten in de Curtain-swipestapel verschijnen (gefactureerd volgens plan)."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Geavanceerd"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "API base URL"
msgstr "Basis-URL van de API"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Only change this for a staging environment."
msgstr "Wijzig dit alleen voor een testomgeving."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Admin e-mail"
msgstr "E-mailadres beheerder"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Send the site admin e-mail with Connect so Curtain can reach you about billing (optional)."
msgstr "Stuur het e-mailadres van de sitebeheerder mee bij het koppelen, zodat Curtain je kan bereiken over facturering (optioneel)."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Verwijderen"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Delete all Curtain settings and product fit data when the plugin is uninstalled."
msgstr "Alle Curtain-instellingen en pasvormgegevens van producten wissen als de plugin wordt verwijderd."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Instellingen opslaan"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "What is sent to Curtain"
msgstr "Wat er naar Curtain wordt gestuurd"

#. translators: %s: API host
#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "After you connect, published products (name, price in EUR, product photos, categories, attributes) and the fit data from the Curtain box on the product page are sent to %s. Nothing about your customers or orders is ever sent. Disconnect at any time."
msgstr "Na het koppelen worden gepubliceerde producten (naam, prijs in EUR, productfoto's, categorieën, attributen) en de pasvormgegevens uit het Curtain-vak op de productpagina naar %s gestuurd. Er wordt nooit iets over je klanten of bestellingen verstuurd. Je kunt op elk moment ontkoppelen."

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Privacy policy"
msgstr "Privacybeleid"

#: includes/class-settings.php
msgid "Terms"
msgstr "Voorwaarden"
